      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Abis ditandain mata elang, hindarin serangan Nakoruru. 2) Damage tinggi dan lincah, butuh control buat ngunci baru bunuh."
    },
    {
      "source": "HoKStats",
      "url": "https://hokstats.gg/heroes/nakoruru/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "skills": [
          {
            "name": "DANCING SWORD ARTS",
            "description": "Enhances her next Basic Attack after landing a skill hit, dealing extra damage.",
            "type": "passive"
          },
          {
            "name": "AMUBE YATORO",
            "description": "Deals damage to a selected enemy and marks them. Damaging a marked enemy triggers the mark, dealing extra damage and reducing the cooldown time of the skill.",
            "type": "skill1"
          },
          {
            "name": "RERA MUTSUBE",
            "description": "Dashes forward, dealing damage to enemies and recovering Health.",
            "type": "skill2"
          },
          {
            "name": "KAMUI MUTSUBE",
            "description": "Gains a Movement Speed boost. Using the skill again deals damage to enemies in the target area, slows them, and reduces their damage output.",
            "type": "ultimate"
          }
        ],
        "pick_when": [
          "The enemy team has carries with limited self-peel that Nakoruru can reach before the team can react",
          "Your team has the structure to use her ability to clear camps efficiently and convert pressure into ganks, since Nakoruru delivers tempo from objectives and cross-map kill threats.",
          "The enemy draft includes Wukong, Athena, and Xiang Yu, who appear in counter data as matchups Nakoruru can pressure."
        ],
        "avoid_when": [
          "Enemy peel is strong and Nakoruru cannot reach the backline without dying first",
          "Your team needs a tank pick more than Nakoruru's specialty, leaving the role unfilled if you commit here.",
          "The enemy already drafted Diaochan, Fang, and Garo, who counter data identifies as direct answers to Nakoruru."
        ],
        "power_spikes": [
          "Early game: jungle clear into level-4 ganks is the first window where Nakoruru can translate routes into kills.",
          "Mid game: with cooldown reduction online, gap-close skills come back fast enough to chain into multiple fights",
          "Late game: full build online, Nakoruru reaches the spike public guides describe — extended fights favor her once items are completed."
        ],
        "common_mistakes": [
          "Diving while enemy hard control is still up, which directly counters Nakoruru's engage.",
          "Ignoring Diaochan and Fang on the enemy team when picking fights — counter data flags them as direct answers, so engage timing must respect their cooldowns.",
          "Pathing predictably and getting tracked by the enemy jungler — vary first clear and rotate based on ward placement rather than muscle memory."
        ],
